===Etymology===
{{der|en|NL.|-}} {{m|mul|Velociraptor}} genus name, from {{af|la|vēlōx|gloss1=swift|raptor|gloss2=thief|nocat=1}}.

The application to [[Deinonychus]] came about because Gregory S. Paul proposed that ''Velociraptor'' and ''Deinonychus'' were the same genus<ref>{{cite-book
